{"id":"32c7ce8536d0e2df","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-arithmetic-realization.md","title":"Arithmetic realization of modal formulas","display":"df-arithmetic-realization — Arithmetic realization of modal formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-arithmetic-realization","aliases":["72-df-arithmetic-realization"],"display":"df-arithmetic-realization — Arithmetic realization of modal formulas","depends_on":["[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]","[[72-df-theory-proof]]","[[72-df-modal-formula]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, section 1, printed p. 476, PDF p. 488","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-arithmetic-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-arithmetic-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-realization — Arithmetic realization of modal formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5f45b7be0b2d491\" href=\"?note=f5f45b7be0b2d491\" title=\"72-df-theory-proof\">72-df-theory-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"94fb82dfe6146007\" href=\"?note=94fb82dfe6146007\" title=\"72-df-modal-formula\">72-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, section 1, printed p. 476, PDF p. 488"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"94fb82dfe6146007\" href=\"?note=94fb82dfe6146007\" title=\"72-df-modal-formula\">72-df-modal-formula</a> 的模态公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_m\">\\(\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>；算术项、公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_a\">\\(\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>、句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_A\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\)</span>、数码、环境和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubNum}_a\">\\(\\operatorname{SubNum}_a\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a>，标准解释关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}\">\\(\\mathsf{AT}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_A\">\\(T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\)</span> 递归可公理化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathcal A_a,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathcal A_a,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 是指定的有限前提Hilbert演算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathcal A_a\">\\(\\mathsf R\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f5f45b7be0b2d491\" href=\"?note=f5f45b7be0b2d491\" title=\"72-df-theory-proof\">72-df-theory-proof</a>。演算及其规则是本定义的输入，不能仅由理论的名称决定。</li>\n<li>固定单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\hookrightarrow\\omega\">\\(e:\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathcal A_a^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\omega\">\\(s:\\mathcal A_a^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner A\\urcorner:=e(A)\">\\(\\ulcorner A\\urcorner:=e(A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_T\\in\\mathcal A_a\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_T\\in\\mathcal A_a\\)</span> 满足下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RepPrf}_{T,\\mathcal C,e,s}(\\mathsf{Prf}_T)\">\\(\\operatorname{RepPrf}_{T,\\mathcal C,e,s}(\\mathsf{Prf}_T)\\)</span>；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\">\\(x_0\\)</span> 接收句码、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1\">\\(x_1\\)</span> 接收证明码，所有坏码的表示值为假。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}_A\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,p,n,i\\in\\omega\">\\(a,p,n,i\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal A_a\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>。在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,e,s,\\mathsf{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathcal C,e,s,\\mathsf{Prf}_T\\)</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{T,f}\">\\(\\rho_{T,f}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pr}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{Pr}_T\\)</span> 使用原有省略参数的记号；不假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 可靠或一致，不据此声称满足理论内可证性条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_{T,\\mathcal C,e,s}(a,p)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathcal A_a^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [a=e(A)\\land p=s(\\pi)\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\pi,A)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{RepPrf}_{T,\\mathcal C,e,s}(P)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow P\\in\\mathcal A_a\\land\\operatorname{fv}_a(P)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [\\mathsf{AT}(P,\\eta)\\leftrightarrow R_{T,\\mathcal C,e,s}(\\eta(0),\\eta(1))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_{T,\\mathcal C,e,s}(a,p)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathcal A_a^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [a=e(A)\\land p=s(\\pi)\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\pi,A)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{RepPrf}_{T,\\mathcal C,e,s}(P)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow P\\in\\mathcal A_a\\land\\operatorname{fv}_a(P)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [\\mathsf{AT}(P,\\eta)\\leftrightarrow R_{T,\\mathcal C,e,s}(\\eta(0),\\eta(1))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProvForm}_T:=\\exists_a x_1\\mathsf{Prf}_T,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pr}_T(\\overline n):=\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(\\operatorname{ProvForm}_T,0,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProvForm}_T:=\\exists_a x_1\\mathsf{Prf}_T,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pr}_T(\\overline n):=\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(\\operatorname{ProvForm}_T,0,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{T,f}(p_i)\\coloneqq f(i),\\qquad\n\\rho_{T,f}(\\bot_m)\\coloneqq(\\mathbf0=_a\\mathsf S(\\mathbf0)),\\qquad\n\\rho_{T,f}(A\\to_m B)\\coloneqq\\rho_{T,f}(A)\\to_a\\rho_{T,f}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{T,f}(p_i)\\coloneqq f(i),\\qquad\n\\rho_{T,f}(\\bot_m)\\coloneqq(\\mathbf0=_a\\mathsf S(\\mathbf0)),\\qquad\n\\rho_{T,f}(A\\to_m B)\\coloneqq\\rho_{T,f}(A)\\to_a\\rho_{T,f}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{T,f}(\\Box_m A)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Pr}_T\\!\\left(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\rho_{T,f}(A)\\urcorner}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{T,f}(\\Box_m A)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Pr}_T\\!\\left(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\rho_{T,f}(A)\\urcorner}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递归翻译的四个构造子条款不变。原来“表示有限T证明的公式”依赖未指定的演算、编码和“表示”约定；现在用书内的有限证明关系和标准解释关系给出完整条件。对象公式中自由变量的两个位置也明确区分，不与另一个算术化接口中“证明码在前”的参数顺序混淆。</p>\n<p>所有坏句码、坏证明码使R为假，因此不是仅对合法数码给出部分表示。该条件是标准模型中的精确表示，不声称T在内部证明这个真值等价，也不为任意演算额外断言这样的算术公式存在。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth","status":"resolved","id":"2ce276183c963d6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-theory-proof","status":"resolved","id":"f5f45b7be0b2d491","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-theory-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"94fb82dfe6146007","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"94fb82dfe6146007","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的模态公式集 $\\mathcal F_m$；算术项、公式 $\\mathcal A_a$、句子 $\\operatorname{Sent}_A$、数码、环境和 $\\operatorname{SubNum}_a$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]，标准解释关系 $\\mathsf{AT}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的模态公式集 $\\mathcal F_m$；算术项、公式 $\\mathcal A_a$、句子 $\\operatorname{Sent}_A$、数码、环境和 $\\operatorname{SubNum}_a$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]，标准解释关系 $\\mathsf{AT}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth","status":"resolved","id":"2ce276183c963d6c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的模态公式集 $\\mathcal F_m$；算术项、公式 $\\mathcal A_a$、句子 $\\opera